# TrustToken Smart Contract Audit Report

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for TrustToken.

TrustToken is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a token and stable asset smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: TrustToken  
Audit type: Token and stable asset smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

## Public Audit Report

[02_Smart Contract Audit_TrustToken.pdf](./02_Smart%20Contract%20Audit_TrustToken.pdf)

## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed smart contract security work for token and stable asset related contract systems.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s smart contract audit work connected to token infrastructure, stable asset contracts and Web3 financial systems.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
